---
source: tests/keys.rs
expression: app.backend()
---
" [1] My Issues │ [2] Team Issues │ [3] Analytics                                "
"┌My Issues─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│No open issues ┌ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────┐                │"
"│               │Issue list                                   │                │"
"│               │  j      Move down                           │                │"
"│               │  k      Move up                             │                │"
"│               │  gg     Move to the top                     │                │"
"│               │  G      Move to the bottom                  │                │"
"│               │  C-d    Move down half a page               │                │"
"│               │  C-u    Move up half a page                 │                │"
"│               │  h      Focus the pane on the left          │                │"
"│               │  l      Focus the pane on the right         │                │"
"│               │  Enter  Open the focused issue              │                │"
"│               │  yi     Copy the identifier                 │                │"
"│               │  yu     Copy the URL                        │                │"
"│               │  yb     Copy the branch name                │                │"
"│               │  ym     Copy a Markdown link                │                │"
"│               │  o      Open in the browser                 │                │"
"│               │  Esc    Close the top overlay or step back  │                │"
"│               │                                             │                │"
"│               └ Esc close ──────────────────────────────────┘                │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" Move │ j down    │ k up                                                        "
" Do   │ Esc close                                                               "
